{"id":"td-2602","category":"teardown","cover":"🔧","region":"global","publishedAt":"2025-05-25","tags":["拆解分析","极星"],"title":{"zh":"【车灯拆解2417】Polestar极星4 大灯","en":"","ko":""},"summary":{"zh":"今天，我们一起来看看Polestar极星4 大灯。先来看看整车大灯外观，\n\n大灯采用双锋刃日行灯设计，造型与极星品牌的家族式设计风格相呼应，依旧能看出几分“雷神之锤”的感觉，很强的","en":"","ko":""},"body":{"zh":"今天，我们一起来看看Polestar极星4 大灯。先来看看整车大灯外观，\n\n大灯采用双锋刃日行灯设计，造型与极星品牌的家族式设计风格相呼应，依旧能看出几分“雷神之锤”的感觉，很强的原创设计感觉。高配大灯搭载了32像素椭球，配置了大灯高度调节,自适应远近光,延时关闭等功能。打开外面罩：\n\n外侧的是像素椭球哦，\n\n后壳上三块散热块均用于日行转向光源：\n\n打开内透镜，可见光导及支架：\n\n继续拆开光导支架，则是最核心的主光源椭球：\n\n拆下远近光外饰圈：\n\n拆下眼眉日行灯：\n\n拆下双椭球：\n\n剩下的就是灯壳（还有风道），结构设计功底相当不错：\n\n来上个全家福：\n\n最后，32像素椭球：\n\n远近光椭球：\n\n写在最后，整灯的结构设计思路相当清晰，零件不多但紧凑，两个椭球也是干净利落，值得点赞~按惯例，这个大灯由海拉提供。","en":"","ko":""},"source":{"name":{"zh":"车灯研究院","en":"Headlight Institute","ko":"차灯연구원"},"type":"web","url":"https://www.dengdengschool.com/article/dengjuchaijie/2602.html","author":""},"media":{"images":["https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/bfpNckwxSiaOtPJHanPME8sLT9UEIAKicVrye4Wcob1DfGEZZHicDTsAROoNiah6IGujLWunCKmVsWOxQTicsWREmzQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&from=appmsg","https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/bfpNckwxSiaOtPJHanPME8sLT9UEIAKicVUzjibNXI0lhbSQDDrMIsGdiaxfhQqXzYxAbrYOrdlymKR4pthRktfJgg/640?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg","https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/bfpNckwxSiaOtPJHanPME8sLT9UEIAKicVUgwm8hsBTaYGNC5Voevq5Uta2Xvubht3pXWQdJpPZr8MkB8sCb0icmg/640?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg","https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/bfpNckwxSiaOtPJHanPME8sLT9UEIAKicVdtszIPmuYTgeCfLySmw5qpRXq78KJbKwkXy0Sd6kTeNPGz7Fz8CTDg/640?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg","https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/bfpNckwxSiaOtPJHanPME8sLT9UEIAKicVTicqTUqibukCujmRHqictEKtd3wmV5UgvRzLtA5fajALvN6RkQqDtPwvQ/640?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg","https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/bfpNckwxSiaOtPJHanPME8sLT9UEIAKicVRhutI2siaYoyMKejicCuvwSLJ05MRCkiaAw2jN9tVYiaoWK0BNWkYoM0Gg/640?wx_fmt=png&from=appmsg","https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/bfpNckwxSiaOtPJHanPME8sLT9UEIAKicVDVxtSEtZ4FnJgDT212GFakr4qo3LHtkvnVgP4ZRYjicJm73w9ugttgQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&from=appmsg","https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz